  "title": "Inside Moon Made Farms: Regenerative Sungrown Cannabis from Humboldt’s Emerald Triangle",
  "summary": "Moon Made Farms is a female-owned regenerative sungrown cannabis farm located in Humboldt County’s Emerald Triangle. Founded by Tina Gordon, the Garberville-based farm cultivates small-batch organic cannabis using living soil, regenerative farming practices, and lunar cultivation principles. From award-winning genetics to its signature Queen Cola releases, Moon Made Farms represents the evolving future of California-sungrown cannabis.",
